@baseUrl = http://localhost:5299

### List robots
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/robots

### List inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### Create an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerReference": "manual-test-1",
  "skus": ["SKU-001", "SKU-002"]
}

### Create an order with an unknown SKU (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerReference": "manual-test-2",
  "skus": ["NOT-A-REAL-SKU"]
}

### Get a single order by id (replace {{orderId}} with an id from "Create an order" above)
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### List pick tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks

### Force an off-cycle dispatch pass
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dispatch/run

### KPIs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kpis
